> fit3.2.4 <- sem(model3.2.4, data=FD)

Either you need to explicitly write intercepts in your model syntax (eg.
carbon3.Mg.ha. ~ 1 + age.2012.)

or you can use the meanstructure=TRUE option, as in

fit3.2.4 <- sem(model3.2.4, data=FD, meanstructure=TRUE).

Yves.

